The inventory of the platform's 64 privileged accounts is still being confirmed with the new operating team, and the review tool cannot yet read the platform's role assignments. The extension plan is still a draft and has not been approved.

You approved exception EXC-2026-014 today for 90 days, so the platform stays outside the July review under it.

So M5 is still in progress. We expect the first review that includes the cloud hosting platform to run in the first half of September 2026, before the committed date of 2026-09-30.

